{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301342","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301342","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430134201:0":{"text":"당연하지. 내가 하루에 다섯 끼나 챙겨주고 있거든. 내가 키우는 칠면조보다 더 통통하다니까!","source_cn":"那当然，我每天给它们吃五顿，比我自己养的火鸡吃的还多！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x652F0ABAFBEDCD63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430134202:0":{"text":"프리다는 편지에서 칠면조들이 말을 잘 안 듣는다고 했지만, 내 손에서는 엄청 얌전하단 말이지.","source_cn":"弗瑞达在信里跟我说这些火鸡很不听话，但在我手里它们乖的很嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3CBC5D9E2EFFE67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430134203:0":{"text":"프리다가 나를 많이 도와줬으니까, 걔가 없는 동안 내가 돌봐주는 거야.","source_cn":"弗瑞达之前帮了我很多，她不在的这段时间，我要帮她照料好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF17A84852A2C3AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:矮人布斯丽":{"text":"드워프 부슬리","source":"矮人布斯丽","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}